# GUI

- Reuse `CarPickerPane`, `PromptPreviewPanel`, `ModeCard`, `SelectableList`, `MonthCalendar`.
- Car list sort («Как в файле» / «По алфавиту») lives in `CarPickerPane`. Horoscope and links use `short_labels=True` (unique make+model).
- The cars list editor is `gui/screens/cars_list.py`; hiding applies only to the repair/tuning builder.
- Preview text must stay selectable (do not `state="disabled"` on the textbox). Copy only via the button; flash «Скопировано» on success.
- Status lines use `MUTED` for hints, `SUCCESS` for copy, `DANGER` for failures. Do not mix selection hints and errors in a way that overwrites without new user action.
- Hide the header «На главную» button on the home screen (`grid_remove`), do not leave it disabled.
- Horoscope and links header titles must match `WORK_MODE_LABELS`.
